1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,675
What if you stopped translating, and started thinking in English?

2
00:00:03,675 --> 00:00:04,733
Here is what happens.

3
00:00:05,933 --> 00:00:10,054
Translating is slow and tiring, and you freeze in the middle of a sentence.

4
00:00:10,054 --> 00:00:12,966
Thinking in English is fast, and the words just come.

5
00:00:14,166 --> 00:00:16,126
Day one, name the things around you.

6
00:00:16,126 --> 00:00:17,106
Cup, door, coffee.

7
00:00:17,106 --> 00:00:19,229
Day three, describe what you are doing.

8
00:00:19,229 --> 00:00:21,733
By day seven, you might even dream in English.

9
00:00:22,933 --> 00:00:23,707
Start tonight.

10
00:00:23,707 --> 00:00:25,312
Name ten things in your room.

11
00:00:25,312 --> 00:00:26,971
Narrate your day in your head.

12
00:00:26,971 --> 00:00:28,741
And stop translating every word.

13
00:00:28,741 --> 00:00:30,733
Try it, and tell me in the comments.

